Your bloodstar effect also burns part of your victim's flesh, dealing [25, 34, 41, 47, 52 (TL1-5; STEAMPOWER 100)] fire damage.

The intensity of the fire generates steam which you psionically absorb through gestalt, providing [3, 6, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] steam each turn (each additional victim steam generation is reduced by 66%).

This damage does not break daze and increases with your Steampower.
